# Whitelist: ignore everything, then include only our own source and docs.
# Never invert this. Extracted game data, logs, environments and keys stay out.
*
!*/

!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/MODLOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/requirements.txt
!/*.bat

!/docs/**/*.md
!/game_assistant/**/*.py
!/tests/**/*.py

# Never, even if matched above
/.venv/
/.local/
/runtime/
**/__pycache__/
